      "subtask_answer": "From sub-problems 3 and 4:  \n\n- \\(|\\pi - 3.14| = \\pi - 3.14\\)  \n- \\(|\\pi - \\frac{22}{7}| = \\frac{22}{7} - \\pi\\)  \n\nAdding them:  \n\n\\[\n(\\pi - 3.14) + \\left(\\frac{22}{7} - \\pi\\right) = \\frac{22}{7} - 3.14\n\\]\n\nNow, \\(3.14 = \\frac{314}{100} = \\frac{157}{50}\\).  \nSo:  \n\n\\[\n\\frac{22}{7} - \\frac{157}{50} = \\frac{22 \\cdot 50 - 157 \\cdot 7}{350} = \\frac{1100 - 1099}{350} = \\frac{1}{350}\n\\]\n\n**Final answer:** \\(\\frac{1}{350}\\)",
